                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7051d1df-d2d0-3658-a667-f2e1805eaba9",
                        "entry_id": "2923e103-8c39-3cce-9e25-2abef66cecef",
                        "glosses": [
                            "книжн., юр. открытость, доступность, публичность информации о деятельности учреждений, организаций, должностных лиц и т. п. для общественного ознакомления, обсуждения"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "89a8479f-c55d-4483-94b2-d0d572644f17",
                                "sense_id": "7051d1df-d2d0-3658-a667-f2e1805eaba9",
                                "text": "Нападения на писателя и оправдания, коим подают они повод, суть важный шаг к гласности прений о действиях так называемых общественных лиц (hommes publics), к одному из главнейших условий высоко образованных обществ."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e291ca04-d9f1-3a80-a554-c19ba34042e8",
                        "entry_id": "2923e103-8c39-3cce-9e25-2abef66cecef",
                        "glosses": [
                            "истор., полит. основной компонент политики перестройки, проводимый М. С. Горбачёвым во второй половине 1980-х годов в СССР и заключавшийся в существенном ослаблении цензуры и снятии существовавших в советском обществе многочисленных информационных барьеров, в том числе и гласности [1]"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1b084e62-1e47-4123-b4b5-fedab840bdaf",
                        "source_entry_id": "2923e103-8c39-3cce-9e25-2abef66cecef",
                        "source_sense_description": "открытость, доступность, публичность",
                        "target_lang_word": "publicity",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "publicity",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d1437c5b-e5a4-3cb3-8371-0f4d5776c5a0",
                                        "entry_id": "2b4d335d-00bf-3da4-a3fd-d27521604863",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Advertising or other activity designed to rouse public interest in something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d9fc6ec-577e-4ba7-9eb1-f6c2ab76896c",
                                                "sense_id": "d1437c5b-e5a4-3cb3-8371-0f4d5776c5a0",
                                                "text": "A gay man accused of disorderly conduct for posting publicity for a Boston gay event was found not guilty in Cambridge District Court on July 22."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e6c22a06-b989-3951-8011-ed013f9d5fb6",
                                        "entry_id": "2b4d335d-00bf-3da4-a3fd-d27521604863",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Public interest attracted in this way."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5f9f963-0c03-44e6-adce-8538a6475bee",
                                                "sense_id": "e6c22a06-b989-3951-8011-ed013f9d5fb6",
                                                "text": "Any publicity, runs the axiom, is good publicity."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "15f6839d-3361-36c0-92f1-bbf767f397ab",
                                        "entry_id": "2b4d335d-00bf-3da4-a3fd-d27521604863",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The condition of being the object of public attention."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d74c47d2-d1a3-3102-99b0-b9167281c397",
                                        "entry_id": "2b4d335d-00bf-3da4-a3fd-d27521604863",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality of being public, not private."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a85d4a78-6bb7-4a6b-baa1-9519c1fc9244",
                                                "sense_id": "d74c47d2-d1a3-3102-99b0-b9167281c397",
                                                "text": "Amelia's gentle eyes, too, had been fixed anxiously on the pair, whose conduct had so chafed the jealous General; but when Rebecca entered her box, she flew to her friend with an affectionate rapture which showed itself, in spite of the publicity of the place; for she embraced her dearest friend in the presence of the whole house, at least in full view of the General's glass, now brought to bear upon the Osborne party."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "de91ce3d-20cf-46cb-9128-5dc9940cd982",
                        "source_entry_id": "2923e103-8c39-3cce-9e25-2abef66cecef",
                        "source_sense_description": "открытость, доступность, публичность",
                        "target_lang_word": "openness",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "openness",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4f770b9e-3458-3bba-bb9e-5ac4990dc2d0",
                                        "entry_id": "ca2248bd-9a95-3993-9cab-9229749d3fdd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Accommodating attitude or opinion, as in receptivity to new ideas, behaviors, cultures, peoples, environments, experiences, etc., different from the familiar, conventional, traditional, or one's own."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d729308c-57c2-40db-ac15-489c55964698",
                                                "sense_id": "4f770b9e-3458-3bba-bb9e-5ac4990dc2d0",
                                                "text": "Francis riled conservative cardinals with his compassion for migrants and refugees, openness towards LGBTQ+ Catholics and demands for action on the climate crisis."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0e783339-7830-3a22-9d98-698a786b7c1c",
                                        "entry_id": "ca2248bd-9a95-3993-9cab-9229749d3fdd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The degree to which a person, group, organization, institution, or society exhibits this liberal attitude or opinion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1f26399f-cbba-3445-a003-c3e00f587d04",
                                        "entry_id": "ca2248bd-9a95-3993-9cab-9229749d3fdd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Lack of secrecy; candour, transparency."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3138e807-cc8d-4ee9-ad25-a0a2e2df8424",
                                                "sense_id": "1f26399f-cbba-3445-a003-c3e00f587d04",
                                                "text": "\"Instead of openness, there was the cunning tactics of cover-up and a complete failure by General De Chastelain to deal with the vital numerics of decommissioning,\" said Ian Paisley, 79, the Protestant preacher who heads the Democratic Unionists, Northern Ireland's largest party."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "adb5787e-5e9f-3708-9a0f-32386ddf6346",
                                        "entry_id": "ca2248bd-9a95-3993-9cab-9229749d3fdd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The degree of accessibility to view, use, and modify in a shared environment with legal rights generally held in common and preventing proprietary restrictions on the right of others to continue viewing, using, modifying and sharing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f170dc8a-ea69-3c0c-904b-83d006e8efec",
                                        "entry_id": "ca2248bd-9a95-3993-9cab-9229749d3fdd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The degree to which a system operates with distinct boundaries across which exchange occurs capable of inducing change in the system while maintaining the boundaries themselves."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4b2c40d8-012f-4a1e-bfe6-b2c4b6e6b4f8",
                        "source_entry_id": "2923e103-8c39-3cce-9e25-2abef66cecef",
